        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/4c67ecffd35a89b0302b02872bf08adc.poster.avif?t=1765299257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/4c67ecffd35a89b0302b02872bf08adc.webm?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/4c67ecffd35a89b0302b02872bf08adc.mp4?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lone survivor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a merciless war against the machines, humanity is on the verge of extinction and robots took control over the planet. The last freedom fighters are desperately trying to drive out the machines and ensure their own survival. As a survivor of the war, this task is in your hands. You must supply the resistance with raw materials and liberate your city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/84cdf452b46fd6b4dd2c9f7f12d27124.poster.avif?t=1765299257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/84cdf452b46fd6b4dd2c9f7f12d27124.webm?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/84cdf452b46fd6b4dd2c9f7f12d27124.mp4?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through randomly generated levels against numerous hostile robots. Beat boss enemies, advance to harder levels and extract your collected loot. Unlock new loadout items and collect loot chests to become stronger. But be warned: The machines let no human pass, they are programmed to destroy and you are all on your own. Every run is a difficult challenge, and if you manage to survive and extract your score and your loot... a new run awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/e0a593fab83257acf8b0f0b14c0ab377.webp?t=1765299257\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/e0a593fab83257acf8b0f0b14c0ab377.poster.avif?t=1765299257\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Human Shall Pass is the first released game from Cheesy Game Development, as a one man leisure project. Everything is original, except for a few free-to-use resources. The idea of the game is to combine roguelike elements with old school arcade run-and-gun shooting games. Development started on November 2023.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heavy metal soundtrack is self composed and recorded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bossfights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unlockable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 different weapons with varying weapon handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different attributes to skill up during every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoreboard to compare with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy metal soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud save</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/4c67ecffd35a89b0302b02872bf08adc.poster.avif?t=1765299257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/4c67ecffd35a89b0302b02872bf08adc.webm?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/4c67ecffd35a89b0302b02872bf08adc.mp4?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lone survivor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a merciless war against the machines, humanity is on the verge of extinction and robots took control over the planet. The last freedom fighters are desperately trying to drive out the machines and ensure their own survival. As a survivor of the war, this task is in your hands. You must supply the resistance with raw materials and liberate your city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/84cdf452b46fd6b4dd2c9f7f12d27124.poster.avif?t=1765299257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/84cdf452b46fd6b4dd2c9f7f12d27124.webm?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/84cdf452b46fd6b4dd2c9f7f12d27124.mp4?t=1765299257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through randomly generated levels against numerous hostile robots. Beat boss enemies, advance to harder levels and extract your collected loot. Unlock new loadout items and collect loot chests to become stronger. But be warned: The machines let no human pass, they are programmed to destroy and you are all on your own. Every run is a difficult challenge, and if you manage to survive and extract your score and your loot... a new run awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/e0a593fab83257acf8b0f0b14c0ab377.webp?t=1765299257\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464550/extras/e0a593fab83257acf8b0f0b14c0ab377.poster.avif?t=1765299257\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Human Shall Pass is the first released game from Cheesy Game Development, as a one man leisure project. Everything is original, except for a few free-to-use resources. The idea of the game is to combine roguelike elements with old school arcade run-and-gun shooting games. Development started on November 2023.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heavy metal soundtrack is self composed and recorded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bossfights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unlockable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 different weapons with varying weapon handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different attributes to skill up during every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoreboard to compare with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy metal soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud save</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "No Human Shall Pass is a run and gun rogue-like game. Shoot your way through a devastated city and extract as much score and loot as possible. Unlock new weapons and loadout items, become stronger through level-up chests and beat countless hostile robots throughout randomly generated levels.",
